Anarch Galastra	interacts with	It's not too late to see the light, Tenno. Even for you.
Anarch Galastra	interacts with	Tell me, Tenno-brat. Why do you still serve the Orokin? Do you really trust them to keep their word?
Anarch Galastra	interacts with	I'm going to die on my estate, here on my moon, surrounded by weeping grandchildren and howling Kubrows. Not now. And not by your hand!
Anarch Galastra	interacts with	Peace isn't won with flowers and songs! You only get peace... through sacrifice!
Anarch Galastra	interacts with	Play the wolf, Tenno. Cut down the suckling lamb and join the side that's going to win.
Anarch Galastra	interacts with	You think... you are the only ones... to command the Frames?
Anarch Galastra	interacts with	Bring me my Ascaris!
Anarch Galastra	interacts with	Little Tenno. You are way out of your depth. Now the big fish are going to devour you. Sentient PV-22! Destroy the medical transport and kill the passenger!
Anarch Galastra	interacts with	... spill an Executor's guts with everyone watching, and not go to war on the spot? No. I know how the Orokin think. Once they see a Sentient disembowel an Executor, the treaty is as good as dead...
Anarch Galastra	interacts with	... He'll come around, or he'll serve as an example...
