Assignator Korffel	interacts with	Well, praise the Void. You two managed to show up on time. Boro Overlook. Go. Now.
Apex Stentor	interacts with	Attention. A rogue Tenno operative and Sentient cohort are suspected of sabotage. They are to be brought in alive or dead.
Apex Stentor	interacts with	Attention. Following the many treacherous Sentient attacks on loyal Grineer and Dax allies, the treaty is null and void. Orokin protection is hereby withdrawn. We are at war.
Apex Stentor	interacts with	Anarch strike is underway! Tauron students, to deployment!
Archimedean Itzam	interacts with	Thank you, Tenno. You two have been a singular headache at times, but I admit I shall miss our classes. Perhaps you might consider returning next year, to speak to the new students.
Archimedean Itzam	interacts with	No time!
Archimedean Itzam	interacts with	Grineer! Excellent!
Archimedean Itzam	interacts with	A graduation present from the lady herself.
Archimedean Itzam	interacts with	When I told Executor Ballas of the peril Tokh-Amn was facing, I little thought he would place me in charge of its defense. In this sacred place, the minds that had begun to grow on our long journey finally flowered. Tenno, Adis, in the spirit of Tokh-Amn I bind your souls together. Be the example we look to, the living truth of peace. The two of you have already been tested deeply, beyond any grade or metric. I have nothing left to teach. I deem you both Tauron Adept. May your union never be sundered.
Archimedean Itzam	interacts with	I have spoken to my fellow Archimedean. Your... consort? It appears the world-seeders have a weakness.
Archimedean Itzam	interacts with	It's Galastra, Executor. Her Anarchs now occupy every one of the known world-seeders. Many of our bloom nurseries lie in ashes! Tokh-Amn itself is threatened! We believe she may be receiving assistance. Executor Nitokh is helping.
Archimedean Itzam	interacts with	Orokin gratitude is like summer lightning: its light is fleeting merely, and wrath soon follows. Wait outside. I shall do what I can.
Archimedean Itzam	interacts with	With the Seven split, Ballas held the casting vote. Peace is entirely in his hands, and the warmongers whisper in his ear day and night. Your presence may offend him.
Archimedean Itzam	interacts with	Your somatic readout indicates emotional stress. I am not judging you for what happened, Tenno. But we must find Adis.
Archimedean Itzam	interacts with	Ah. the lament of the true Archimedean. 'Insufficient data'.
Archimedean Itzam	interacts with	To be promised land as a reward for fighting, only to see it given to the enemy... It must be bitter indeed.
Archimedean Itzam	interacts with	A sound hypothesis. We know she can undo the liberating effect of the blooms.
Archimedean Itzam	interacts with	Let us hope so. Now. What would you say is Galastra's goal?
Archimedean Itzam	interacts with	And so you returned without Adis? Most unfortunate. Your, ah, patron has asked me to inquire about... the voices?
Archimedean Itzam	interacts with	The treaty is not as finished as we would wish. The conditions laid upen our stewardship -
Archimedean Itzam	interacts with	No cheating! Especially when the answer is grievously incorrect! Would you embarrass us so before the Seven?
Archimedean Itzam	interacts with	No cheating! If you are tested by the Seven, we must show your evolution to their ways.
Archimedean Itzam	interacts with	When the applications of Tauron are applied to Naramon's theories, what is the expected outcome?
Archimedean Itzam	interacts with	Adis Truth-Bloom, have you adapted to the Tenno Ways?
Archimedean Itzam	interacts with	Ah, please, please, with me. The place for conflict is in the dojo.
Daklo	interacts with	Yes. Yes, of course. Thank you.
Daklo	interacts with	The Grineer were prepared. They knew. The moment Ballas announced the treaty was dead, they opened fire!
Daklo	interacts with	Tenno? Dear Void... I saw it all!
Daklo	interacts with	Tenno, I know you're loyal and you want this to work, but you know it as well as I do: there is something deeply amiss with the Sentients. If they're so proud of who they are, then why do they want to be human so badly? And every time they try, it's just off, isn't it? Just know you have a friend in me if you ever need to talk.
Daklo	interacts with	Watch your mouth, void-lugger.
Daklo	interacts with	Disgusting, isn't it? Orokin gold - wasted! I wonder... which of you would this aberration attack first?
Margulis	interacts with	We can finally begin to heal.
Margulis	interacts with	I will not have them accuse you of treason. If they come for you, they will have to go through me.
Margulis	interacts with	You had a very hard day, my angel, and we have a long journey back to Lua. The Dream will keep the voices from taking hold.
Margulis	interacts with	You already know the truth.
Margulis	interacts with	Galastra tried to steal the life of my love. For that alone she deserves death. But the complete extinction of the Tau blooms, which she plans to bring about, would hurl us back into a state of war. With the collusion of Executor Nitokh and her lackey Roathe, she has sequestered herself and her followers within the world-seeders, the armored Zariman Ova of old. But they have a flaw. A destruct sequence. This Ayatan holds the trigger codes. Deliver it to the world-seeder's heart and turn Galastra's fortress into her funeral pyre.
Margulis	interacts with	I trust Itzam over the Orokin. Have him report to me daily.
