Ballas	interacts with	In the name of the Seven, the Lady Margulis and I welcome the delegates of the Sentient Collective. How brightly Perintol's odd little star shines now.
Ballas	interacts with	Your people faced extinction, you found wisdom, and now you rise. Peace is trembling in our hands. Let us boldly grasp it.
Ballas	interacts with	Close the door.
Ballas	interacts with	The moon Perita is soon to be sovereign Sentient territory, per article 92. 'All Orokin forces to withdraw.' Remain and we violate the treaty, depart and we abandon a friend in need! What, then, would you have me do about Galastra?
Ballas	interacts with	Wise Itzam. First of the Sentient Archimedeans. Speak.
Ballas	interacts with	Remember this.
Ballas	interacts with	We swore to carry the sacred light of our dominion into the deepest dark, and this we have done! Swear now to defend this holy treaty alongside our blessed and brave creations: the Sentients of Tau.
