Loid	interacts with	Tenno, I must ask you to pace yourself! Nobody doubts your strength, but the Dark Refractory places a murderous burden on the user. If you persist in your current state, there is a real risk that we will lose you!
Loid	interacts with	Murmur. Breaking the perimeter seals. Flooding the labs. It's over.
