Loid	interacts with	We're losing them.
Loid	interacts with	You're not on Tau. This is a memory. It happened. And I'm so sorry, but we can't change any of it.
Loid	interacts with	(background) No way to tell without joining them, wherever they are.
Loid	interacts with	(background) Barely. Cataleptic state. Vitals marginal.
