Adis	interacts with	Hunger. For orders. If none come... hivemind would return.
Adis	interacts with	With the blooms, Tau made us free. All know this.
Adis	interacts with	Adis not talk.
Adis	interacts with	Maybe through hive-kin... they try to find a way?
Adis	interacts with	Dax cannot defy Kuva. But Anarchs defy Orokin? How?
Adis	interacts with	Lus-tra-tus? They lead. They know orders from Galastra. Make them tell!
Adis	interacts with	Tenno, go after ones with big shiny hat!
