Operator	interacts with	I'm so sorry.
Operator	interacts with	But Ballas... if he did this... he'll kill y-you...
Operator	interacts with	You're going to make me forget.
Operator	interacts with	Why am I sleepy?
Operator	interacts with	Tell me you had nothing to do with it!
Operator	interacts with	Rap, tap, tap! You'll let me in, little piggy!
Operator	interacts with	Burn with the rest of them.
Operator	interacts with	A change of heart? From a bigot like you? I don't buy it.
