Operator	interacts with	What did you see?
Operator	interacts with	I should've let Galastra tear you apart!
Operator	interacts with	Coward! Come out and face me!
Operator	interacts with	You changed the codes! Didn't you?
Operator	interacts with	Ballas!
Operator	interacts with	I wouldn't do that.
Operator	interacts with	Bury him.
Operator	interacts with	Did you know?
Operator	interacts with	Adis? C'mon, sit up. C'mon.
Operator	interacts with	Shh. It's okay. It's okay. We're together.
Operator	interacts with	(coughing, hacking)
Operator	interacts with	They're coming to kill us both! Don't you see? They'll cover it up! They always do!
Operator	interacts with	Margulis couldn't have done this! Think, Adis! This is a setup!
Operator	interacts with	Adis, you've got to stop! This is what they wanted!
Operator	interacts with	No!
Operator	interacts with	Ballas and the others. They used us. Set us up.
Operator	interacts with	We've got to get out!
Operator	interacts with	Adis. I deserve to know...
Operator	interacts with	Prep the machine, Loid. I have to go back.
Operator	interacts with	(gulping water)
Operator	interacts with	But we're almost at the part where...
Operator	interacts with	Loid. What. No. You can't be here on Tau.
Operator	interacts with	It's... me. I can't do this. I don't want to do this!
Operator	interacts with	Ready?
Operator	interacts with	Wait! We should help!
Operator	interacts with	How??
Operator	interacts with	Valdur? Come in, damn it! You've got a rogue battalion down here!
Operator	interacts with	Valdur? Respond!
Operator	interacts with	They're not ours!
Operator	interacts with	You were born here? It's beautiful.
Operator	interacts with	But I saved his life!
Operator	interacts with	Seal the doors, Loid. I have to go deeper.
Operator	interacts with	Ballas!
Operator	interacts with	You...
Operator	interacts with	That's her plan? She's insane.
Operator	interacts with	Adis... did... did your people do this?
Operator	interacts with	Keep monitoring, Adis. We need to know more.
Operator	interacts with	One of the Seven!
Operator	interacts with	Tauron student, first class division M four dash A. By the glory and wisdom of the Seven I salute you.
Operator	interacts with	This was a VIP transport. Whoever Galastra's hunting, they're Orokin.
Operator	interacts with	Galastra shot down a shuttle. She's got to be after the passengers.
Operator	interacts with	Need to redeploy, Adis!
Operator	interacts with	The downed shuttle. Where is it?
Operator	interacts with	Okay. Codes.
Operator	interacts with	Gonna scramble this targeting array, Adis. That ought to bring a Lustratus out of hiding.
Operator	interacts with	But what happens if you don't get them?
Operator	interacts with	How is Galastra controlling Sentients?
Operator	interacts with	Sorry. Talking to myself.
Operator	interacts with	Shut. UP.
Operator	interacts with	Orokin houses clash all the time. Dax can kill troops, they just can't hurt the Golden Lords themselves.
Operator	interacts with	What's Galastra hunting?
Operator	interacts with	Can you narrow it down?
Operator	interacts with	Adis, get on comms. We need intel. I'm going after them.
Operator	interacts with	Never. So, uh... do you wanna go hunting? With me?
Operator	interacts with	Yeah. Me too.
Operator	interacts with	You lost something.
Operator	interacts with	Adis?
Operator	interacts with	I know where he'll be.
Operator	interacts with	There are still too many unknown factors.
Operator	interacts with	Tau. All of it. Just for her and her people.
Operator	interacts with	War. Using the Sentients as her tools.
Operator	interacts with	The voices are under control.
Operator	interacts with	I killed him, Lotus.
Operator	interacts with	I'm sorry! I didn't want to! It was him or me... him or me!
Operator	interacts with	You're the only ones keeping this war alive.
Operator	interacts with	The shields, Adis!
Operator	interacts with	Ready?
Operator	interacts with	Go charge up, Adis. I've got your back.
Operator	interacts with	I see them.
Operator	interacts with	Shut up!
Operator	interacts with	Let's go, 'truth-bloom!'
Operator	interacts with	So... the Seven are coming?
Operator	interacts with	It's a trick question.
Operator	interacts with	A regression in stability.
Operator	interacts with	A new Somatic connection.
Operator	interacts with	Again? Okay, don't sweat it. I've got your back.
Operator	interacts with	Anything you want to go over before Itzam grills you?
Operator	interacts with	I've been working on some new moves. Gonna let me try them out on you?
Operator	interacts with	Did they ever tell you what happened to your ancestors?
Operator	interacts with	Oh, they'd invite you to dinner, then panic over what to feed you.
Operator	interacts with	It's just... insane. When all the time it could have been like this.
Operator	interacts with	Can you believe we used to be at war?
Operator	interacts with	Relax. We've got this.
